{"5012960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pawnshop Together", "steam_appid": 5012960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your own pawn shop solo or with friends. Buy items, negotiate with customers, repair broken goods, and sell them for a good price!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/eaff984884dacf9735d192fbaf98d59f.avif?t=1787925822\" width=323 height=88 /></span><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/37330e5ef77fa473b8092f3aa9b2ca05.poster.avif?t=1787925822\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/37330e5ef77fa473b8092f3aa9b2ca05.webm?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/37330e5ef77fa473b8092f3aa9b2ca05.mp4?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Each item has its own price, but customers will always try to get more out of you. Negotiate, make your offer, and try to strike a deal before they give up and leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/9358f7a67b67d78107621513194378ca.avif?t=1787925822\" width=323 height=88 /></span><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/9371e6781333b667a41c4582fb459720.poster.avif?t=1787925822\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/9371e6781333b667a41c4582fb459720.webm?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/9371e6781333b667a41c4582fb459720.mp4?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Not everything that looks valuable is the real deal. Inspect items for hidden clues, repair damaged goods, and get them ready for the shop floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/d65391212244228299ce1db600e214f2.avif?t=1787925822\" width=323 height=88 /></span><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/d641ca9b2ddf8d36dca7e301855ddc6b.poster.avif?t=1787925822\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/d641ca9b2ddf8d36dca7e301855ddc6b.webm?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/d641ca9b2ddf8d36dca7e301855ddc6b.mp4?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Stock your shelves, serve customers, build your reputation, and expand your store as your business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/1059d65b65fb87cc786f7051fb843628.avif?t=1787925822\" width=323 height=88 /></span><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/bfcdd781a93239fafd7125dd027231af.poster.avif?t=1787925822\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/bfcdd781a93239fafd7125dd027231af.webm?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/bfcdd781a93239fafd7125dd027231af.mp4?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Step outside and explore the town. Search for buried valuables with a metal detector, pull forgotten items from the water, ride around town, and find other ways to make money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/d2134ff3ba1348701d6a6ab004f247ec.avif?t=1787925822\" width=323 height=88 /></span><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/6107b0fad78084cbe54967471bf0fe29.poster.avif?t=1787925822\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/6107b0fad78084cbe54967471bf0fe29.webm?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/6107b0fad78084cbe54967471bf0fe29.mp4?t=1787925822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Join local auctions, compete for valuable items, and decide how far you're willing to push the price. There are plenty of other ways to try your luck and make some extra money, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012960/extras/570e705ff0a182ee6a4dfc21b57d1d53.avif?t=1787925822\" width=323 height=88 /></span><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla